From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:37:05 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: Ask applies a suggested setup with one button

The setup suggestion ends with a block Meridian reads: new spaces and link
rules for sites that were sent. A card previews them; Apply makes them;
Undo takes back exactly those (a space with tabs in it stays).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
